<http://data.silknow.org/object/353fdd06-b2c3-34d9-b9e7-661e1f55e84c/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Embroidered flat, wallet shaped purse of canvas, embroidered with laid silver and silver-gilt thread and with polychrome silks, in tent stitch. The metal thread is laid across the entire surface of the purse and the silks are worked over it to produce a tapestry-like effect. The purse is stiffened, and lined with blue silk taffeta. The flap originally fastened with a loop and button, but the latter is missing.\nOn the front of the purse is a pastoral scene of sheep beneath a tree with a house, birds and outsized insects. On the back is a large house with trees, stags and birds.\nThe edges are bound with silver-gilt braid."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/353fdd06-b2c3-34d9-b9e7-661e1f55e84c> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/353fdd06-b2c3-34d9-b9e7-661e1f55e84c/domain/1>
